*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% ===========================================================================
*% HBPL driver for the FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA / 2150 N family.
*%
*% The device has no page description language: FUJIFILM's own specification
*% lists "HBPL (Host Based Print Language)", i.e. the host renders and
*% halftones every page.  There is no macOS driver, and the machine cannot be
*% driven with PostScript or PCL.
*%
*% This PPD wires up a CUPS filter chain that uses only software already on
*% the Mac plus one small filter:
*%
*%   PDF --> cgpdftoraster (built into macOS) --> CUPS raster (8-bit grey)
*%       --> rastertohbpl (this driver, error-diffusion halftone)
*%       --> HBPL --> socket://IP:9100
*%
*% The raster is 8-bit continuous-tone grey on purpose.  cgpdftoraster's own
*% 1-bit halftone is a 64x64 tiled dither mask (2.7 mm repeat at 600 dpi),
*% which prints photos as visible square tone patches; the filter dithers the
*% 8-bit grey itself with Floyd-Steinberg error diffusion instead.
*%
*% Set the device URI with:  lpadmin -p <queue> -v socket://<printer-ip>:9100
*% ===========================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.8"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsLanguages: "en zh_CN"
*PCFileName: "FXA2350H.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "FUJIFILM"
*ModelName: "FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA"
*Product: "(FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA)"
*ShortNickName: "FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA"
*NickName: "FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA (HBPL driver)"
*Throughput: 23
*cupsSingleFile: True
*cupsMaxCopies: 99
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*cupsICCProfile Gray../Grayscale: "/System/Library/ColorSync/Profiles/Generic Gray Gamma 2.2 Profile.icc"
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*cupsBackSide: Normal
*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off (1-Sided): "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge (Portrait): "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge (Landscape): "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*OpenUI *Collate: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: True
*Collate True: "<</Collate true>>setpagedevice"
*Collate False: "<</Collate false>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate
*DefaultOutputOrder: Normal
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A3: "<</PageSize[841.8898 1190.5512]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4: "<</PageSize[595.2756 841.8898]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5: "<</PageSize[419.5276 595.2756]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5: "<</PageSize[515.9055 728.5039]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter: "<</PageSize[612.0000 792.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal: "<</PageSize[612.0000 1008.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize FanFoldGermanLegal: "<</PageSize[612.0000 936.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A3: "<</PageSize[841.8898 1190.5512]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4: "<</PageSize[595.2756 841.8898]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5: "<</PageSize[419.5276 595.2756]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5: "<</PageSize[515.9055 728.5039]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter: "<</PageSize[612.0000 792.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal: "<</PageSize[612.0000 1008.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion FanFoldGermanLegal: "<</PageSize[612.0000 936.0000]/ImagingBBox null/Orientation 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A3: "841.8898 1190.5512"
*ImageableArea A3: "11.3386 11.3386 830.5512 1179.2126"
*PaperDimension A4: "595.2756 841.8898"
*ImageableArea A4: "11.3386 11.3386 583.9370 830.5512"
*PaperDimension A5: "419.5276 595.2756"
*ImageableArea A5: "11.3386 11.3386 408.1890 583.9370"
*PaperDimension B5: "515.9055 728.5039"
*ImageableArea B5: "11.3386 11.3386 504.5669 717.1653"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612.0000 792.0000"
*ImageableArea Letter: "11.3386 11.3386 600.6614 780.6614"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612.0000 1008.0000"
*ImageableArea Legal: "11.3386 11.3386 600.6614 996.6614"
*PaperDimension FanFoldGermanLegal: "612.0000 936.0000"
*ImageableArea FanFoldGermanLegal: "11.3386 11.3386 600.6614 924.6614"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 215.4331 841.8898
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 359.9999 1190.5512
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 3
*CustomPageSize True: ""
*% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*% The filter.  CUPS accepts absolute paths, which is required here because
*% /usr/libexec/cups/filter is read-only under SIP.  install.sh rewrites this
*% path if a different prefix is used.
*% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 @FILTER@"
*zh_CN.Translation Manufacturer/FUJIFILM: "富士胶片"
*zh_CN.Translation ModelName/FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA: "富士胶片 Apeos 2350 NDA"
*zh_CN.Translation ShortNickName/FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA: "富士胶片 Apeos 2350 NDA"
*zh_CN.Translation NickName/FUJIFILM Apeos 2350 NDA (HBPL driver): "富士胶片 Apeos 2350 NDA (HBPL 驱动)"
*zh_CN.Translation PageSize/Media Size: "纸张尺寸"
*zh_CN.Translation PageRegion/Media Size: "纸张尺寸"
*zh_CN.Translation Duplex/2-Sided Printing: "双面打印"
*zh_CN.Translation Resolution/Output Resolution: "输出分辨率"
*zh_CN.Translation ColorModel/Color Mode: "颜色模式"
*zh_CN.Translation Collate/Collate: "逐份打印"
*zh_CN.PageSize A3/A3: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize A4/A4: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize A5/A5: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize B5/B5: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize Letter/Letter: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize Legal/Legal: ""
*zh_CN.PageSize FanFoldGermanLegal/8.5x13 英寸: ""
*zh_CN.PageRegion A3/A3: ""
