*zh_CN.PageRegion A5/A5: ""
*zh_CN.PageRegion B5/B5: ""
*zh_CN.PageRegion Letter/Letter: ""
*zh_CN.PageRegion Legal/Legal: ""
*zh_CN.PageRegion FanFoldGermanLegal/8.5x13 英寸: ""
*zh_CN.Duplex None/关闭（单面）: ""
*zh_CN.Duplex DuplexNoTumble/长边翻页（纵向）: ""
*zh_CN.Duplex DuplexTumble/短边翻页（横向）: ""
*zh_CN.Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: ""
